# Personal self-model data stays local to each clone. This repository is
# published as a reusable agent harness only; entity content (Subject,
# Source, Event, Claim, Pattern, Measurement records) and everything
# generated from it never leaves the local working copy. See
# docs/operations.md for the local-only workflow.
entities/subjects/*.md
!entities/subjects/README.md
entities/sources/*.md
!entities/sources/README.md
entities/events/*.md
!entities/events/README.md
entities/claims/*.md
!entities/claims/README.md
entities/patterns/*.md
!entities/patterns/README.md
entities/measurements/*.md
!entities/measurements/README.md
data/
overviews/coverage.md

